46
00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:53.328 line:15%
I sure can.

47
00:01:53.328 --> 00:01:54.666 line:15%
Thank you.

48
00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:55.690
Now, I love the way people cut bread,

49
00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:57.130
