52
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.060
Like flat and open? Or do you wanna cut it pieces?

53
00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:04.893
You could do that.

54
00:02:04.893 --> 00:02:06.890
I'm also like a throw it in the oven,

55
00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:09.590
and then tear it so it's nice and crusty.

56
00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:11.630
Also saves some time.

57
00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:14.390
I think if you do it on L1 Drew, that's gonna be fine.

58
00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:17.340
So my sauce over here is coming up to a boil,

59
00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:20.030
and I'm gonna throw in those mussels, Drew.

60
00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:23.260 line:15%
Okay? Because these are gonna take maybe

61
00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:25.290 line:15%
