62
00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:28.510 line:15%
and you know the mussels are steamed

63
00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.910 line:15%
when they fully open.

64
00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:32.660 line:15%
So Drew, we're gonna throw in your mussels.

65
00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:34.350 line:15%
I'm ready.
Cover it.

66
00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.333 line:15%
Give that a good shake around,

67
00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:39.343 line:15%
