75
00:02:57.511 --> 00:02:59.140
(audience laughing)

76
00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.790
I can't believe I'm actually seeing you chop herbs.

77
00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:02.960
I know, I'm so excited.

78
00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:04.977
This is probably like the one dish where I'm like,

79
00:03:04.977 --> 00:03:07.713
"Okay I'm gonna bring my knife to the party."

80
00:03:07.713 --> 00:03:12.170
